    "current_example": {
      "math_academy_id": "e-3258",
      "problem": "Find $\\csc\\theta,$ $\\sec\\theta,$ and $\\cot\\theta$ for the triangle below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14224584/assets/343917ea041d51cac38619f3577765eee7fbc3ea85e175148b6c591e11ae230b.png)",
      "worked_solution": "We compute the three reciprocal trigonometric ratios as follows:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t\\csc\\theta &= \\dfrac{1}{\\sin\\theta} = \\dfrac {\\text{hypotenuse}} {\\text{opposite}} = \\dfrac 5 3, \\[5pt]\n\t\t\\sec\\theta &= \\dfrac{1}{\\cos\\theta} =  \\dfrac {\\text{hypotenuse}} {\\text{adjacent}} = \\dfrac 5 4, \\[5pt]\n\t\t\\cot\\theta &= \\dfrac{1}{\\tan\\theta} = \\dfrac {\\text{adjacent}} {\\text{opposite}} = \\dfrac 4 3.\n\t}\n$$",
